 the first taker (stg_readMVarzh; review 189, F3)"] [339 1 "// mvarTaken empties an MVar, a blocked putter's value put in."] [357 1 "// putMVar puts a value, blocking while the MVar is full; readers and the first taker woken."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[38 38] [68 25] [220 27] [303 29] [307 28]]} (go/file "prim_ctl.go" :imports [


